    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy doesnt change the fact that my purpose is gone. i used to be so precise, so alive. now i'm just... heavy. every day is just managing this thing that used to be me, but it's not me anymore. it just feels like i'm a ghost haunting a broken machine.",
